        180,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Receptionist 4: Log Row\nCalled by **Receptionist 2** without waiting, so a slow Google Sheets append never holds up the caller. Adds one row to the **Messages** tab of the Front Desk sheet.",
